<p>FYI, it is possible in newer browsers to use a combination of Local Storage and data URIs to implement your own image caching, but I'd be surprised if there was any real world situation where that was required and if you have a lot of images, you may run into storage limits on Local Storage quicker than limits on the size of the browser cache.</p>

